# New Feature Checklist with TDD Approach
# Reference when adding new domain entities or features
# Each phase follows: Write Test (RED) → Implement (GREEN) → Manual Test → WAIT

---
alwaysApply: true
---

## TDD-Based Feature Development

When adding a new feature, follow this TDD-integrated checklist:

### Phase 1: Database Setup
| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1.1 | Add `CREATE TABLE` to `db/hsqldb/initDB.sql` |
| 1.2 | Add `CREATE TABLE` to `db/mysql/initDB.sql` |
| 1.3 | Add `CREATE TABLE` to `db/postgresql/initDB.sql` |
| 1.4 | Add foreign key constraints |
| 1.5 | Add indexes on FK columns and frequently queried fields |
| 1.6 | Add `INSERT` statements to all three `populateDB.sql` files |

**After Phase 1:** Notify user → WAIT for confirmation

---

### Phase 2: Domain Model (Entity)

**TDD Steps:**
| Step | Action | Result |
|------|--------|--------|
| 2.1 | Write unit test for entity validation | |
| 2.2 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ❌ RED |
| 2.3 | Create entity class in `model/` package | |
| 2.4 | Extend base class (`BaseEntity`, `NamedEntity`, or `Person`) | |
| 2.5 | Add `@Entity` and `@Table` annotations | |
| 2.6 | Add column mappings with `@Column` | |
| 2.7 | Add validation annotations (`@NotEmpty`, `@NotNull`, etc.) | |
| 2.8 | Add relationship annotations (`@ManyToOne`, `@OneToMany`) | |
| 2.9 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ✅ GREEN |

**After Phase 2:** Notify user → WAIT for confirmation

---

### Phase 3: Repository Layer

**TDD Steps:**
| Step | Action | Result |
|------|--------|--------|
| 3.1 | Write unit test for repository methods | |
| 3.2 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ❌ RED |
| 3.3 | Create repository interface in `repository/` | |
| 3.4 | Define CRUD methods with `throws DataAccessException` | |
| 3.5 | Create Spring Data JPA implementation in `repository/springdatajpa/` | |
| 3.6 | Add `@Profile("spring-data-jpa")` annotation | |
| 3.7 | Use `LEFT JOIN FETCH` in custom queries | |
| 3.8 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ✅ GREEN |

**After Phase 3:** Notify user → WAIT for confirmation

---

### Phase 4: Service Layer

**TDD Steps:**
| Step | Action | Result |
|------|--------|--------|
| 4.1 | Write unit test for service methods | |
| 4.2 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ❌ RED |
| 4.3 | Add methods to `ClinicService` interface | |
| 4.4 | Implement methods in `ClinicServiceImpl` | |
| 4.5 | Add `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` for read operations | |
| 4.6 | Add `@Transactional` for write operations | |
| 4.7 | Handle not-found cases (return null) | |
| 4.8 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ✅ GREEN |

**After Phase 4:** Notify user → WAIT for confirmation

---

### Phase 5: REST API Layer

**TDD Steps:**
| Step | Action | Result |
|------|--------|--------|
| 5.1 | Write unit test for controller endpoints | |
| 5.2 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ❌ RED |
| 5.3 | Add endpoint definitions to `openapi.yml` | |
| 5.4 | Add schema definitions to `openapi.yml` | |
| 5.5 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd compile` to generate DTOs | |
| 5.6 | Create mapper interface in `mapper/` | |
| 5.7 | Create controller implementing generated API interface | |
| 5.8 | Add `@PreAuthorize` annotations for security | |
| 5.9 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ✅ GREEN |

**After Phase 5:** Notify user → WAIT for confirmation

---

### Phase 6: Security (If New Role Needed)

**TDD Steps:**
| Step | Action | Result |
|------|--------|--------|
| 6.1 | Write unit test for security/authorization | |
| 6.2 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ❌ RED |
| 6.3 | Add role constant to `security/Roles.java` | |
| 6.4 | Configure role in security configuration | |
| 6.5 | Run `.\mvnw.cmd test` | ✅ GREEN |

**After Phase 6:** Notify user → WAIT for confirmation

---

### Phase 7: Documentation

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 7.1 | Update relevant baseline PRD in `docs/baseline/` |
| 7.2 | Update `ARCHITECTURE.md` if architecture changes |
| 7.3 | Update README.md if needed |

**After Phase 7:** Notify user → Feature Complete

---

## Quick Reference: File Locations

| Component | Location |
|-----------|----------|
| SQL Schema | `src/main/resources/db/{database}/initDB.sql` |
| SQL Data | `src/main/resources/db/{database}/populateDB.sql` |
| Entity | `src/main/java/.../model/EntityName.java` |
| Repository Interface | `src/main/java/.../repository/EntityRepository.java` |
| Spring Data Repo | `src/main/java/.../repository/springdatajpa/SpringDataEntityRepository.java` |
| Service Interface | `src/main/java/.../service/ClinicService.java` |
| Service Impl | `src/main/java/.../service/ClinicServiceImpl.java` |
| OpenAPI Spec | `src/main/resources/openapi.yml` |
| Mapper | `src/main/java/.../mapper/EntityMapper.java` |
| Controller | `src/main/java/.../rest/controller/EntityRestController.java` |
| Roles | `src/main/java/.../security/Roles.java` |
| Tests | `src/test/java/.../rest/controller/EntityRestControllerTests.java` |

