## Common Mistakes Reference

### Database Mistakes
| ❌ Mistake | ✅ Fix |
|-----------|--------|
| Only updating hsqldb scripts | Update all three database scripts |
| Using `AUTO_INCREMENT` in HSQLDB | Use `INTEGER IDENTITY` |
| Missing indexes on FK columns | Add `CREATE INDEX` for all FKs |
| Wrong table order in initDB.sql | Parents before children |

### Entity Mistakes
| ❌ Mistake | ✅ Fix |
|-----------|--------|
| Using `List<>` for @OneToMany | Use `Set<>` |
| Missing `mappedBy` | Always specify on inverse side |
| Exposing internal collections | Return unmodifiable views |
| Missing validation | Add `@NotEmpty`, `@NotNull`, etc. |

### Repository Mistakes
| ❌ Mistake | ✅ Fix |
|-----------|--------|
| Missing `@Profile` annotation | Add `@Profile("spring-data-jpa")` |
| N+1 query problems | Use `LEFT JOIN FETCH` |
| Positional parameters | Use named parameters with `@Param` |

### Service Mistakes
| ❌ Mistake | ✅ Fix |
|-----------|--------|
| Field injection | Use constructor injection |
| Missing `@Transactional` | Add to all methods |
| Using `@Transactional` for reads | Use `readOnly = true` |
| Throwing exception for not found | Return null |

### Controller Mistakes
| ❌ Mistake | ✅ Fix |
|-----------|--------|
| Injecting repository directly | Use ClinicService |
| Returning entity directly | Use mapper to DTO |
| Missing `@PreAuthorize` | Add security annotation |
| Wrong HTTP status codes | Follow REST conventions |

### TDD Mistakes
| ❌ Mistake | ✅ Fix |
|-----------|--------|
| Writing code before tests | Always write test FIRST |
| Skipping RED verification | Verify test FAILS before implementing |
| Proceeding without user approval | WAIT after each phase |

