## Useful Commands

```bash
# Run specific test
.\mvnw.cmd test -Dtest=TestClassName

# Run all tests
.\mvnw.cmd test

# Build project
.\mvnw.cmd clean install

# Run application
.\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run

# Generate DTOs from OpenAPI
.\mvnw.cmd compile
```
